   "proposition": "In the rio format table, the English row for gzip comma-separated data (.csv.gz) states \"Yes\" under \"Installed by Default\"; the Portuguese row has \"v\" in that cell instead of \"Sim\".",
   "reader_consequence": "A Portuguese reader consulting the table cannot tell whether rio handles .csv.gz out of the box, and may install an extra package or avoid the format unnecessarily.",
